  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Fifth Night</hi> of the <hi rend="allcaps">New Farce</hi>.<lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps">Theatre Royal, Lyceum,</hi></placeName><lb/>
               Under the Authority of the Lord Chamberlain.<lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, <date when="1811-10-18">October 18, 1811.</date><lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will perform,<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">(For the First Time at this Theatre,)</hi><lb/>
               a Comedy called, The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_way_to_get_married">Way to get Married.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Tangent,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewis</hi>,</actor><lb/>
                  <hi rend="italic">(From the Theatre Royal, York, being his 1st Appearance at this Theatre.)</hi></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Toby Allspice,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Faulkner,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Putnam</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Caustic,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_penson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Penson</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dick Dashall,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mc. Query,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_pa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Palmer</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Landlord,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Mr. Maddocks,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Shopman,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_evans">Mr. Evans,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Ned,</role> <actor>Mr. Miller,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Jailor,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#gh_sp">Mr. Sparks,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Geoffry,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Mr. Chatterley,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Officer,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#al_we">Mr. Webb,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>William,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br_fi">Mr. Fisher,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Solicitor,</role> <actor>Mr. Buxton,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Undertaker,</role> <actor>Mr. Lee,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Postilion,</role> <actor>Mr. Jamieson,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Clerk,</role> <actor>Master Seymour,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Julia Faulkner,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#el_ed">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Edwin</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Celmentina Allspice,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ha">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Harlowe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Sorrel,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_sp">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Sparks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Fanny,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ch">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which, (<hi rend="italic">5th time</hi>) a New Musical Farce in Two Acts, called The<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_green_eyed_monster">Green-Eye'd Monster</title><lb/>
               <title type="sub"><hi rend="italic">Or, How to get your Money!</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> (with the exception of the Overture) entirely New, Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#th_we">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">T. Welsh</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="allcaps">The Characters By</hi></head>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ha_me">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Mellon</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#je_vi">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bew</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_bl">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bland</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi>, at the Box Office in the Strand<lb/>
               Entrance, of whom may also be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <measure type="currency">6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be opened at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="18:30:00">half past Six</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">No Money to be Returned. Vivant Rex et Regina.</hi></ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
